---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Terms and Conditions"
	description="Read the Thinker Scripts terms and conditions for using the website, reading published content, linking to articles, and contacting the publication."
	keywords={[
		'Thinker Scripts terms and conditions',
		'website terms',
		'terms of use',
		'content usage terms',
	]}
>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<p class="font-mono text-xs text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">TERMS & CONDITIONS</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-none text-pretty text-neutral-950 sm:text-7xl dark:text-white">
			Terms and Conditions.
		</h1>
		<p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
			These terms describe the basic conditions for using Thinker Scripts. Last updated June 6, 2026.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="border-y border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 py-14 dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-4xl gap-8 px-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Use of the Website</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
					You may read, share, and link to public pages on Thinker Scripts for lawful purposes. You may not use the website in a way that disrupts access, attempts unauthorized access, or misrepresents the publication.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Content</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
					Unless otherwise stated, published writing, page copy, and site materials belong to Thinker Scripts. Short excerpts may be quoted with attribution and a link to the source page.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">No Professional Advice</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
					The site publishes commentary and educational material. It does not provide legal, financial, security, or professional advice tailored to a specific situation.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div>
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-neutral-950 dark:text-white">Changes and Contact</h2>
				<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300">
					These terms may be updated as the site evolves. Questions can be sent to <a class="underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white" href="mailto:hello@thinkerscripts.com">hello@thinkerscripts.com</a>.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
